{"4121910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Where Heaven Fell", "steam_appid": 4121910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5005450], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WHERE HEAVEN FELL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A challenging 2D platformer about ascending a city forgotten by mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Amid forgotten structures, tunnels, and overgrown ruins, the sky glows an eerie white. As one of the few survivors, you embark on a journey to find the Holy Father and leave this forsaken world behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">✧ GAME FEATURES ✧</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• Distinct movement mechanics.</strong><br>Slide, dash, and climb through the ruins of the last city standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• Unique level design and mechanics.</strong><br>Ranging from dash refills to ziplines, the game has a wide range of level mechanics that each differ from each other fundamentally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• 20 major locations to explore freely</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• Characters that each have their own story to tell</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">about the crumbling world around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• Mysteries and in-depth lore</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">about what truly happened to the city which you attempt ascending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• An immersive soundtrack of 20 melodies,</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">composed by SlayTheAnimation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• 10+ hours of gameplay</strong>climbing, dashing, talking, and reading ancient logs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• Five different endings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• ..And a man, who’s faith for the Holy Father lasts unwavering for generations on end.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">✧ YOUR ASCENT AWAITS ✧</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether you’re searching for a challenge or an atmospheric ascent to prove your faith worthy, Where Heaven Fell is the precision platformer that you’re looking for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WHERE HEAVEN FELL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A challenging 2D platformer about ascending a city forgotten by mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Amid forgotten structures, tunnels, and overgrown ruins, the sky glows an eerie white. As one of the few survivors, you embark on a journey to find the Holy Father and leave this forsaken world behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">✧ GAME FEATURES ✧</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• Distinct movement mechanics.</strong><br>Slide, dash, and climb through the ruins of the last city standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• Unique level design and mechanics.</strong><br>Ranging from dash refills to ziplines, the game has a wide range of level mechanics that each differ from each other fundamentally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• 20 major locations to explore freely</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• Characters that each have their own story to tell</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">about the crumbling world around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• Mysteries and in-depth lore</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">about what truly happened to the city which you attempt ascending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• An immersive soundtrack of 20 melodies,</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">composed by SlayTheAnimation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• 10+ hours of gameplay</strong>climbing, dashing, talking, and reading ancient logs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• Five different endings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>• ..And a man, who’s faith for the Holy Father lasts unwavering for generations on end.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">✧ YOUR ASCENT AWAITS ✧</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether you’re searching for a challenge or an atmospheric ascent to prove your faith worthy, Where Heaven Fell is the precision platformer that you’re looking for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "An unnamed climber, you search for the Holy Father in your ascent to the pinnacle of the city in which the remainder of the world resides in. A lone traveler accompanies you in your climb. Dash, jump, and climb your way to ascension in this challenging 2D platformer!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121910/4b5a545be940db27303aa360b9467af824a5a08f/header.jpg?t=1785226401", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121910/b24458a3661cc2448cbdc264e80a70fb44643e51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785